OL,3,GNEWSAWoman named in A(1M) murder crash
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetective investigating the alleged
OL,7,Fmurder of a woman in a crash on the
OL,8,FA(1M) have released the victim's name.
OL,10,FElena Chiriac, 22 from Newcastle, died
OL,11,Fwhen a silver Ford Transit and a silver
OL,12,FVolkswagen Golf collided on the
OL,13,Fsouthbound carriageway on 4 October in
OL,14,Fthe Barton area, north of Scotch
OL,15,FCorner, North Yorkshire Police said.
OL,17,FFlorin Chiriac, 31 also from Newcastle,
OL,18,Fhas been charged with her murder,
OL,19,Fattempted grievous bodily harm, and
OL,20,Fdangerous driving, and is due to appear
OL,21,Fat Leeds Crown Court on 6 November.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
